---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout title="Terms of Service | ZTEIST" lang="en">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-zte-navy">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-gray-500">ZTEIST (中友会) is a colleagues-and-alumni community for former ZTE talent. By using the platform, you agree to the following terms.</p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">1. Our Service</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>The platform offers colleague search, supply/demand/job/project matching, and referral attribution.</li>
      <li>The service is currently free; any future membership or paid tiers will be announced in the Member Center.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">2. Account and Eligibility</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Eligibility: you have worked at ZTE or any of its subsidiaries at home or abroad (see "Join").</li>
      <li>One account per person, with truthful information.</li>
      <li>Your account is personal and may not be transferred or rented.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">3. Code of Conduct</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Be truthful: fill in your profile and post content honestly.</li>
      <li>Respect privacy: do not misuse or harass others' contact information.</li>
      <li>Do not disturb: no mass advertising or spam.</li>
      <li>No illegal, violent, fraudulent, or otherwise harmful content.</li>
      <li>No selling, renting, or lending of accounts.</li>
      <li>No scraping or bulk harvesting of platform data.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">4. Content Rules</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Supply/demand, job, and project posts must be truthful, lawful, and relevant to the platform.</li>
      <li>The platform may take down content that violates these rules.</li>
      <li>You are responsible for the content you publish.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">5. Account and Termination</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>For violations, the platform may, depending on severity, take down content, restrict account functions, suspend or permanently ban the account, and reserve the right to pursue legal liability.</li>
      <li>You may delete your account at any time (see "Privacy Policy" for data handling).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>You retain ownership of the content you publish, and grant the platform a license to display it on the platform.</li>
      <li>The platform's name, logo, mascot, and other brand assets belong to the platform.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">7. Disclaimer</h2>
    <ul class="mb-8 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>The platform is a matching and information service; it does not participate in, nor guarantee, any transaction, cooperation, or interaction between members.</li>
      <li>Any cooperation or transaction based on platform information is at the parties' own risk.</li>
      <li>Content published by users is the responsibility of the publisher; the platform does not guarantee its truthfulness, accuracy, or legality.</li>
      <li>The platform does not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free service, and is not liable for impacts from force majeure or third-party services (such as Google sign-in or email delivery).</li>
      <li>To the extent permitted by law, the platform is not liable for any indirect or incidental damages.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">8. Applicable Law</h2>
    <p class="mb-8">These terms are governed by the laws of Mainland China.</p>

    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-zte-navy">9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time; updates will be posted on the platform, and continued use constitutes acceptance.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
